<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Orçamento da ordem de serviço nº <%= numero %></title>
</head>
<body style="margin: 0; padding: 0;">
  <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background-color: #f4f4f5; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #3f3f46;">
    <tr>
      <td align="center" style="padding: 24px 12px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #3f3f46;">
        <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="max-width: 600px; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #3f3f46;">
          <tr>
            <td style="padding: 20px 28px; background-color: #18181b; color: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0;">
              <div style="font-size: 13px; color: #a1a1aa;">Orçamento</div>
              <div style="font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold;">Ordem de serviço nº <%= numero %></div>
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td style="padding: 24px 28px;">
              <p style="margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: 16px;">Olá, <%= nome %>.</p>
              <p style="margin: 0 0 20px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px;">
                O orçamento do seu veículo está pronto e aguarda a sua aprovação para iniciarmos o serviço.
              </p>

              <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="margin-bottom: 20px; font-size: 14px;">
                <tr>
                  <td style="padding: 8px 12px; background-color: #f4f4f5; width: 90px; color: #71717a;">Veículo</td>
                  <td style="padding: 8px 12px; background-color: #f4f4f5;"><%= veiculo.marca %> <%= veiculo.modelo %> <%= veiculo.ano %></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td style="padding: 8px 12px; color: #71717a;">Placa</td>
                  <td style="padding: 8px 12px;"><%= veiculo.placa %></td>
                </tr>
              </table>

              <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;">
                <thead>
                  <tr>
                    <th align="left" style="padding: 10px 12px; border-bottom: 2px solid #18181b;">Item</th>
                    <th align="center" width="60" style="padding: 10px 12px; border-bottom: 2px solid #18181b;">Qtd.</th>
                    <th align="right" width="120" style="padding: 10px 12px; border-bottom: 2px solid #18181b;">Valor</th>
                  </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                  <% itens.forEach((item) => { %>
                  <tr>
                    <td style="padding: 10px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid #e4e4e7;"><%= item.descricao %></td>
                    <td align="center" style="padding: 10px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid #e4e4e7;"><%= item.quantidade %></td>
                    <td align="right" style="padding: 10px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid #e4e4e7;"><%= item.valor %></td>
                  </tr>
                  <% }) %>
                </tbody>
                <tfoot>
                  <tr>
                    <td colspan="2" align="right" style="padding: 14px 12px; font-weight: bold;">Total</td>
                    <td align="right" style="padding: 14px 12px; font-weight: bold; font-size: 16px;"><%= total %></td>
                  </tr>
                </tfoot>
              </table>
            </td>
          </tr>
        </table>
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>
</body>
</html>
